ace over the 5-day period before, during, and after a ferocious, seemingly liberating typhoon, which six of the students endure while marooned in their school.","tagline":"We're in the gym at midnight, we're in the eye of the typhoon!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"台風の接近とともに言いようのない感情の高ぶりを見せ騒乱状態に陥る中学生たちの姿を瑞々しく描き出した青春映画の傑作。監督は「セーラー服と機関銃」「ションベン・ライダー」の相米慎二。東京近郊の地方都市。私立中学校のプールに夜、5人の生徒たちが泳ぎにやってくる。彼女たちは先に来ていた男子生徒に気づき、イタズラをするが度が過ぎて溺死寸前の状態に追い込んでしまう。翌朝、ニュースでは台風の接近を告げていた。以来、生徒たちの間で徐々に何かが狂い始めていくようだった……。","tagline":"俺たち真夜中の体育館、いま台風の目の中だ!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZ1jQPtkMOft9ncdmFO6QhFplWz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wOis85Mrc0WYfYQcnFgOAtRwcaw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":108634,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qXv4UwGTwnhdatpnKdRCyrMUDl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8qXv4UwGTwnhdatpnKdRCyrMUDl.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lC9kQhSJPG7a1qBnoo03lXAVmfs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lC9kQhSJPG7a1qBnoo03lXAVmfs.jpg","language":"en","width":1066,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hfvWxizYV5ykLbyHrOzMKPbuhYG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/